    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42a675e929774eaa9546a3ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿，要来个粉丝服务之类的吗？\\n谢谢大家的支持喔～！开玩笑的啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7024fa7540c1bc12df14d787e859e0cb91f9d60e236dcc388fe13fe2425dd49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b92416a30c920f8eda4365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～别看我这样，其实我很兴奋。\\n有种「咦？真的是我吗？」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afe0a2c7627970909959aa75a090e0cd5ee3f99b370dcde854b8c72ffd753a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e804cf0c7ef83d43a22906f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿，要来个粉丝服务之类的吗？\\n谢谢大家的支持喔～！开玩笑的啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7024fa7540c1bc12df14d787e859e0cb91f9d60e236dcc388fe13fe2425dd49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6445391ac4db11ba733fd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～别看我这样，其实我很兴奋。\\n有种「咦？真的是我吗？」的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8afe0a2c7627970909959aa75a090e0cd5ee3f99b370dcde854b8c72ffd753a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38cf35b90c0c6cf7fc691399",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已告诉过他不需举杯庆祝──别搞错了。\\n我就是庆祝胜利的酒杯！众人为我心醉便可！",
      "source_fingerprint": "174842ed1878cc96dec8c45c5d848382a640db8e1ad6eed21954af1caf9d073e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b69b6aa0d5efe311a609fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "享用晚餐──此刻，我的五脏六腑如同深渊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8784614fa730fb0c50d5070dbd7f1f7918b453202d7e36034429759f86383cb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbca64485f9941d6c0942ff5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑的新酒（NOUVEAU）是灵感之源。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbc14db167fc2fd9b1a79faadb6ba125204031b5357ba589ece3b03e8629de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac7dfa1b42879845b0cf187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然有──那就是胜利的女神（Nike）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae4768fafc24f46630198e4b17915f9471ef1f08309e3d3fdf3aebd836786ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d82fb1ad48f11300c4c3291",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我最喜欢跟大家一起跑步了♪\\n获胜的话就又可以跟大家一起跑啰！太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f3293495dc6772b1ad2edc12c634e49a68c6b03a0094cb1a5ce4d0eab52b55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d7ccb4e41a957a4a50e10d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比起永恒闪耀的星光，\\n不如化为贯穿黑夜的雷电。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4fb0632b0cc771a4e94ad50cf6c7532144cfe21287b72680d4c69a4a28dc4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2785023c324fe4caa5223ee3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑的新酒（NOUVEAU）是灵感之源。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cecbc14db167fc2fd9b1a79faadb6ba125204031b5357ba589ece3b03e8629de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0324fce5a64661572a4691ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然有──那就是胜利的女神（Nike）！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ae4768fafc24f46630198e4b17915f9471ef1f08309e3d3fdf3aebd836786ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00151fad1b946c52ce3eeab8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比起永恒闪耀的星光，\\n不如化为贯穿黑夜的雷电。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff4fb0632b0cc771a4e94ad50cf6c7532144cfe21287b72680d4c69a4a28dc4a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b428c29cbf1764e8be54ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的足迹是胜利的符文。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d09efc9e6d32847779ca3d47f6031cd84674ccbaef539467f93b2f5a45a40ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:970a2b408a9cbb5ec79e340b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，报导里就这么写吧。\\n──「美酒的速度太快了」！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1245265bedb48391099f5a7ddbbb0e79646207e57f504762ff0ebee40d2d68b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb44a666aa4d2b477253662d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的足迹是胜利的符文。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d09efc9e6d32847779ca3d47f6031cd84674ccbaef539467f93b2f5a45a40ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ee856c863516f713467f0d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，报导里就这么写吧。\\n──「美酒的速度太快了」！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1245265bedb48391099f5a7ddbbb0e79646207e57f504762ff0ebee40d2d68b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a439f476fd20623d96bfbbec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我和老家的狗经常一起追逐！\\n嘿嘿，最初的竞争对手或许是它吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac4c0277e6e7594025f44d095698e94217617b5f821e7c4256a0b8283bc2660",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bea7e400ffd0139399d681c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竟然有这么多强劲的赛马娘……\\n哈哈！我兴奋得背脊都在打颤呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d826ba64b52e5edb4f1493896372ffd4f5ebe57861822aeb6af5d080d57e1850",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2935ded5779a7b2c831c63d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「乌拉拉漫游」！是去寻找暖～呼呼场所的\\n探险活动！既开心又好玩喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b375dbd211652679bf7f7508657304d8e12a3685b0d126f86fed3d77274a5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9cab2d873f6617803cfe6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "找到「想赢过她」的强敌！\\n就像对我而言如天衣无缝般的那个赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cfc47f5c784a21f0edf3530f968c1efe8aa1068d1c42abbaa915a7f36c97b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4524b4c5c1c32f0fb84784f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～我想是和训练员一起吃的饭吧！\\n和那个人在一起会让我的心情很放松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84cecebb59af7d728f7604e66364531c86e4117ec03123972e61bb29cdda0819",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ff5853ab3be791318e75655",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气氛非常热烈啊！这么多的人潮，\\n在故乡的烟火大会也很难看到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00545a00029e93f24fbceef105ce26df3acd42a4a543f9fb67e7406bb7065c75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beea20ddab086ad4a7b154e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "找到「想赢过她」的强敌！\\n就像对我而言如天衣无缝般的那个赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cfc47f5c784a21f0edf3530f968c1efe8aa1068d1c42abbaa915a7f36c97b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a4763f1da3fe1ff337e030",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯～我想是和训练员一起吃的饭吧！\\n和那个人在一起会让我的心情很放松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84cecebb59af7d728f7604e66364531c86e4117ec03123972e61bb29cdda0819",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09fecaa114211a26a1f5f5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气氛非常热烈啊！这么多的人潮，\\n在故乡的烟火大会也很难看到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00545a00029e93f24fbceef105ce26df3acd42a4a543f9fb67e7406bb7065c75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceebc4b8333402d8f22ebd1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，可以说「我做到啦」，对吧！\\n各位都见证了我成为王牌的精彩表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60d2dfe33d38bf698bd1e221adcace42ed403c9f0664196adb9b5e7686702fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dd4feefc25fe685c270559d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉确实很棒，但可不代表这样就结束了\\n──毕竟我总有一天要成为世界的王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8e9a3a7dd61cc4ea9a6bf3111abb34e403322f980e5286036685e61c8493c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070664cbdba1ff0a77a48353",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈哈，可以说「我做到啦」，对吧！\\n各位都见证了我成为王牌的精彩表现吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e60d2dfe33d38bf698bd1e221adcace42ed403c9f0664196adb9b5e7686702fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d07130e4689acf48f3818e2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉确实很棒，但可不代表这样就结束了\\n──毕竟我总有一天要成为世界的王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc8e9a3a7dd61cc4ea9a6bf3111abb34e403322f980e5286036685e61c8493c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19e712f74067b6187e4fac54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑完了一场非常热血的比赛！\\n下一场比赛也会有激烈对决喔──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a46ffa2a25c2fa9a598bff9586338fc8287147984b65ce49b4926210ecdd6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ae58bc794b80e876e5a8ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我非常笨拙，所以……只会勇往直前！\\n我与训练员的话语一起奔驰了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "442779df600d89d97ab73d5f2f6ed5b5063d3ae7ff5be54e39f448f801178445",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ad524f6f3430dbb1ccf887",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望在正式上场前不要看到乌鸦。\\n即使看到……我也会闭上眼睛快走！",
      "source_fingerprint": "530158005265d3b84bab691ed78f1202f239be080786e32a0b9aa5c5de44335f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e49997df89ea7b894f2c5c48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的很高兴！不管怎么样，亲手做的东西\\n总是会让我感动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33f64d6dbeca3baac4c4c30949ec98edd27acc54509def5b910b428c9e900a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6734f8e9059ef08033645422",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会焚香！那是母亲为我调配的花香，\\n闻起来能使我感到安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa18e21dabd8a22a6ed423a327dd83faf14a90a349c6964959d897251acc4e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a42da0d9192677989a6e3ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胡萝……啊，应该要回答的比较有趣一点。\\n那就……在胡萝卜田！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68bcdf0ab314d0384c38f042069f72983066b6883c294072e5600861bb3e14b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5ea6d0519e3179242b179d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的很高兴！不管怎么样，亲手做的东西\\n总是会让我感动不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a33f64d6dbeca3baac4c4c30949ec98edd27acc54509def5b910b428c9e900a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e3f73e066ed46ea271365a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会焚香！那是母亲为我调配的花香，\\n闻起来能使我感到安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa18e21dabd8a22a6ed423a327dd83faf14a90a349c6964959d897251acc4e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad6fa253d8dcbed6e8bb346",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胡萝……啊，应该要回答的比较有趣一点。\\n那就……在胡萝卜田！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a68bcdf0ab314d0384c38f042069f72983066b6883c294072e5600861bb3e14b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
