    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a795ab75c3e7149019648d26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我接到了祖母打来的祝贺电话哦\n——她说，我又向完美迈进了一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be59ac23bc9134f82310f71c83703a29f0b544b743404aca7d38389ebafa1c4",
